{\f1 FastTrackStudio}\
\
This installer sets up the FastTrackStudio desktop app and the FTS plugin suite.\
\
\'95  {\f1 FastTrackStudio.app} \'97 installed to /Applications\
\'95  {\f1 FTS Plugins} \'97 CLAP + VST3, installed to /Library/Audio/Plug-Ins\
\
Everything is selected by default. Click {\f1 Customize} to choose exactly what gets installed \'97 you can turn the whole plugin suite off with one click, or expand it and pick individual plugins.\
\
Re-running a newer version of this installer upgrades whatever is already installed, in place.\
